1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,313
{\an8}THE LAST TENDER

2
00:00:03,713 --> 00:00:06,400
The tender comes on the first of the month.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,988
It came on the first of last month.

4
00:00:09,388 --> 00:00:11,263
- And the month before.
- Yes.

5
00:00:11,663 --> 00:00:12,863
So it will come.

6
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:15,825
<i>He did not say it like a question.</i>

7
00:00:16,225 --> 00:00:18,038
There is flour for nine days.

8
00:00:18,438 --> 00:00:22,250
- Ten, if we stop the bread.
- We are not stopping the bread.

9
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:23,850
Then nine.

10
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:25,812
I signed for three years.

11
00:00:26,212 --> 00:00:28,275
You signed for three years twice.

12
00:00:28,675 --> 00:00:30,300
The second time I read it.

13
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:31,900
- Did you.
- No.

14
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,487
<i>The light turns. The room goes white, then dark, then white.</i>

15
00:00:36,887 --> 00:00:39,137
My daughter will be eleven in March.

16
00:00:39,537 --> 00:00:40,737
You have said.

17
00:00:41,137 --> 00:00:42,950
I will say it again in March.

18
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:44,550
- Radio.
- I know.

19
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:46,150
It is only weather.

20
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,175
It is always only weather.

21
00:00:48,575 --> 00:00:51,512
Skerry Point, Skerry Point, this is the tender.

22
00:00:51,912 --> 00:00:54,287
- Say something.
- I am thinking what.

23
00:00:54,687 --> 00:00:55,887
Say we are here.

24
00:00:56,287 --> 00:00:58,225
We are here. We have been here.

25
00:00:58,625 --> 00:01:02,437
<i>Static, and under it, something that might be a voice.</i>

26
00:01:02,837 --> 00:01:04,037
Did you hear that?

27
00:01:04,437 --> 00:01:05,637
I heard the sea.

28
00:01:06,038 --> 00:01:07,238
Under the sea.

29
00:01:07,638 --> 00:01:10,388
- Say it again.
- Skerry Point. We are here.

30
00:01:10,788 --> 00:01:13,100
<i>Nothing. Then the light turns.</i>

31
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,750
Flour for nine days.

32
00:01:15,150 --> 00:01:16,350
Ten.

33
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:19,125
- We are not stopping the bread.
- No.

34
00:01:19,525 --> 00:01:20,725
No.

